{"4591740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Numpad Chef: Pizza Rush", "steam_appid": 4591740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Numpad Chef: Pizza Rush</i>, your numpad becomes your cooking tool. No need to drag mouse, because of your newly invited machine you can cook pizza with just typing right combinations of keyboard keys. Master a completely unique control scheme where speed and accuracy are the difference between a perfect order… and a burnt disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/8a6da7eac1b0ac23eecea1b840f3f8d1.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>From raw dough to finished pizza, every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/159c793d84cc3cba3ddae87703e5b8cf.poster.avif?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/159c793d84cc3cba3ddae87703e5b8cf.webm?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/159c793d84cc3cba3ddae87703e5b8cf.mp4?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare dough and sauce base with precise inputs  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add toppings in the correct order  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake to perfection  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve that 100/100 pizza before time runs out  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/68049e1a6405906d4ba5d1fa632cc801.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>Orders start simple, but they don’t stay that way. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type fast, cook faster  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle multiple orders at once  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React quickly to changing demands  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your workflow clean and efficient </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can slow everything down. Too many and the kitchen falls apart. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/f4fce0a8af3199b655155b1683eef9c8.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>Varieties of Dough, Sauces and Toppings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/9716ad6c065a6ab7fdd9721763bfce83.poster.avif?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/9716ad6c065a6ab7fdd9721763bfce83.webm?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/9716ad6c065a6ab7fdd9721763bfce83.mp4?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/4e1330edaf5c4ca91f6977abfe6131a2.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>Meet exciting new characters and family who visit you farm restaurant. Make your customers love your beautiful open farm restaurant so they visit again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/ad8400035fa2ddecae238fa6c0abad2f.avif?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Numpad Chef: Pizza Rush</i>, your numpad becomes your cooking tool. No need to drag mouse, because of your newly invited machine you can cook pizza with just typing right combinations of keyboard keys. Master a completely unique control scheme where speed and accuracy are the difference between a perfect order… and a burnt disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/8a6da7eac1b0ac23eecea1b840f3f8d1.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>From raw dough to finished pizza, every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/159c793d84cc3cba3ddae87703e5b8cf.poster.avif?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/159c793d84cc3cba3ddae87703e5b8cf.webm?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/159c793d84cc3cba3ddae87703e5b8cf.mp4?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare dough and sauce base with precise inputs  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add toppings in the correct order  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake to perfection  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve that 100/100 pizza before time runs out  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/68049e1a6405906d4ba5d1fa632cc801.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>Orders start simple, but they don’t stay that way. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type fast, cook faster  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle multiple orders at once  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React quickly to changing demands  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your workflow clean and efficient </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can slow everything down. Too many and the kitchen falls apart. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/f4fce0a8af3199b655155b1683eef9c8.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>Varieties of Dough, Sauces and Toppings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/9716ad6c065a6ab7fdd9721763bfce83.poster.avif?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/9716ad6c065a6ab7fdd9721763bfce83.webm?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/9716ad6c065a6ab7fdd9721763bfce83.mp4?t=1787394672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591740/extras/4e1330edaf5c4ca91f6977abfe6131a2.webp?t=1787394672\" width=780 height=48 /></span>Meet exciting new characters and family who visit you farm restaurant. Make your customers love your beautiful open farm restaurant so they visit again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img